        "id": "reading-current-evidence",
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "What a current assessment must establish",
        "content": "A defensible contemporary account needs to separate manufacturing output, trade, distribution and agricultural use. FAOSTAT maintains separate product and nutrient datasets, with fertilizer questionnaires and trade statistics among the documented inputs. Those datasets provide a framework for further research, but their existence alone does not verify any particular Iranian observation. [s3][s4]\n\nThe historical evidence establishes a diversified industry and a longstanding concern with balanced nutrition. Establishing its present scale requires inspected annual observations and recent operating evidence; neither old production figures nor earlier demand forecasts can serve as current measurements. [s1][s2]",
        "source_ids": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]
      }
